--- task
id: s07
dataset: social
kind: distinct count under an existence test
answer: fewest

--- intent
How many distinct names do the people who liked at least one comment have? Return the number as `names`.

--- edition2
query liker_names() {
  match { $p: Person  exists { $p likesComment $c } }
  return { count(distinct $p.name) as names }
}

--- edition3
query liker_names() {
  match { $p: Person  exists { $p likesComment $c } }
  return { count(distinct $p.name) as names }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["names"]
[2]
